1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,111
Bugungi videomiz nima haqida? — „Taassurotlarni baham koʻrish“.

2
00:00:09,111 --> 00:00:17,383
Videoning bir joyida yapon tilida savol beriladi. Agar eshitsangiz, izoh qoldiring.

3
00:00:18,343 --> 00:00:21,343
1-sahna: Kinolar haqida / Kinolar haqida gaplashamiz

4
00:00:21,343 --> 00:00:25,550
Yaqinda juda koʻp kino koʻrdim.

5
00:00:25,574 --> 00:00:27,552
Yaxshi ekan!

6
00:00:27,576 --> 00:00:30,543
Qanday kinolarni koʻrdingiz?

7
00:00:30,566 --> 00:00:36,299
Jangari, qoʻrqinchli va multfilm koʻrdim.

8
00:00:36,322 --> 00:00:39,089
Koʻp koʻrgansiz-ku!

9
00:00:39,112 --> 00:00:42,358
Jangari kino qanday edi?

10
00:00:42,381 --> 00:00:45,192
Juda qiziqarli edi.

11
00:00:45,216 --> 00:00:48,983
Erkak qahramon juda kelishgan edi.

12
00:00:49,006 --> 00:00:51,661
Shovqinli kino edi-mi?

13
00:00:51,684 --> 00:00:55,327
Ha, juda shovqinli edi.

14
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:58,629
Koʻp mashinalar yurardi.

15
00:00:58,653 --> 00:01:01,586
Bu juda yaxshi koʻrinadi.

16
00:01:01,609 --> 00:01:04,448
Qoʻrqinchli kino qanday edi?

17
00:01:04,471 --> 00:01:08,366
Qoʻrqinchli kino juda qoʻrqinchli edi.

18
00:01:08,390 --> 00:01:10,957
Qiziqarli edi-mi?

19
00:01:10,980 --> 00:01:15,386
Yoʻq, unchalik qiziqarli emas edi.

20
00:01:15,409 --> 00:01:17,303
Nega?

21
00:01:17,327 --> 00:01:22,994
Koʻp joylari qorongʻi edi, shuning uchun yaxshi koʻrmadim.

22
00:01:23,017 --> 00:01:25,017
Shunday ekan.

23
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:28,240
Qoʻrqinchli kinolar qiyin boʻladi-ku.

24
00:01:28,263 --> 00:01:34,096
Ha, kecha kechasi umuman uxlay olmadim.

25
00:01:34,119 --> 00:01:37,586
Bu juda qiyin boʻldi-ku.

26
00:01:37,609 --> 00:01:40,375
Multfilm qanday edi?

27
00:01:40,398 --> 00:01:44,332
Multfilm juda qiziqarli edi.

28
00:01:44,355 --> 00:01:46,526
Qanday hikoya edi?

29
00:01:46,549 --> 00:01:50,116
Koʻp yoqimli hayvonlar chiqdi.

30
00:01:50,139 --> 00:01:52,872
Musiqasi ham yaxshi edi.

31
00:01:52,895 --> 00:01:55,229
Rasmlari chiroyli edi-mi?

32
00:01:55,253 --> 00:01:59,053
Ha, rasmlari juda chiroyli edi.

33
00:01:59,076 --> 00:02:01,209
Taassurot qoldirdi.

34
00:02:01,232 --> 00:02:05,766
Uchta kino ichida qaysi biri eng yoqdi?

35
00:02:05,789 --> 00:02:09,284
Multfilm eng yoqdi.

36
00:02:09,307 --> 00:02:11,674
Yana koʻrmoqchiman.

37
00:02:11,697 --> 00:02:15,501
Menga jangari kinolar yoqadi.

38
00:02:15,525 --> 00:02:17,939
Navbatda birga koʻrmaymizmi?

39
00:02:17,962 --> 00:02:19,729
Yaxshi ekan!

40
00:02:19,752 --> 00:02:22,085
Birga boramiz.

41
00:02:22,108 --> 00:02:25,242
Keyingi shanba kuni qanday?

42
00:02:25,266 --> 00:02:28,302
Shanba kuni mos keladi.

43
00:02:28,326 --> 00:02:30,659
Soat nechada boramiz?

44
00:02:30,682 --> 00:02:33,286
Soat ikkitadan keyin qanday?

45
00:02:33,309 --> 00:02:35,161
Yaxshi ekan!

46
00:02:35,184 --> 00:02:38,761
Vokzal yaqinidagi kinoteatrga boramizmi?

47
00:02:38,785 --> 00:02:43,318
Ha, u yer yangi va katta.

48
00:02:43,341 --> 00:02:45,078
Tushunarli.

49
00:02:45,102 --> 00:02:47,754
Chipta qancha turadi?

50
00:02:47,777 --> 00:02:50,377
Ikki ming yen.

51
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,800
Men sotib olaman.

52
00:02:52,823 --> 00:02:54,633
Rahmat.

53
00:02:54,656 --> 00:02:56,701
Xursandman.

54
00:02:56,725 --> 00:02:59,725
Yo'q, arzimaydi.

55
00:02:59,748 --> 00:03:01,751
Juda qiziqish bilan kutaman!

56
00:03:01,775 --> 00:03:06,627
Ha, men ham jangari filmlarni yoqtiraman.

57
00:03:06,650 --> 00:03:09,017
Popkorn ham yeyishimiz kerak.

58
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:10,894
Yaxshi ekan!

59
00:03:10,917 --> 00:03:14,684
Men shirin popkornni yoqtiraman.

60
00:03:14,707 --> 00:03:19,840
Men tuzli popkornni yoqtiraman, shuning uchun ikkisini ham olamiz.

61
00:03:19,863 --> 00:03:21,903
Shunday qilamiz.

62
00:03:21,927 --> 00:03:24,816
Qorni ochib qoldi.

63
00:03:24,839 --> 00:03:28,053
Shanba kuni ko'rishamiz.

64
00:03:28,076 --> 00:03:31,310
Ha, juda sabrsizlik bilan kutaman.

65
00:03:31,333 --> 00:03:34,338
Xo'p, shanba kuni ko'rishguncha.

66
00:03:34,361 --> 00:03:41,466
Bugungi videodagi mavzuni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasi tavsif qismida va eng yuqori kommentda bor. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan o'chirilishi mumkin.

67
00:03:41,466 --> 00:03:44,466
2-Sahna: Doʻstlar bilan ovqatlanish tajribasi / Doʻstlar bilan taom tajribasi

68
00:03:44,466 --> 00:03:50,202
Kecha doʻstlarim bilan restoranga bordim.

69
00:03:50,225 --> 00:03:52,116
Yaxshi ekan!

70
00:03:52,140 --> 00:03:55,140
Nima yedingiz?

71
00:03:55,163 --> 00:03:58,702
Turli xil taomlar yedim.

72
00:03:58,725 --> 00:04:02,392
Kari va pirog yedim.

73
00:04:02,415 --> 00:04:05,748
Kari va pirogmi?

74
00:04:05,771 --> 00:04:09,371
G'alati kombinatsiya ekan.

75
00:04:09,394 --> 00:04:11,127
Ha.

76
00:04:11,150 --> 00:04:15,221
Kari juda achchiq edi.

77
00:04:15,245 --> 00:04:18,411
Achchiq taomlarni yoqtirasizmi?

78
00:04:18,434 --> 00:04:20,268
Ha.

79
00:04:20,291 --> 00:04:24,424
Achchiq edi, lekin juda mazali edi.

80
00:04:24,447 --> 00:04:27,090
Yaxshi bo'ldi.

81
00:04:27,114 --> 00:04:30,084
Pirog qanday edi?

82
00:04:30,107 --> 00:04:34,074
Pirog juda shirin edi.

83
00:04:34,097 --> 00:04:36,669
Qulupnayli pirogmi?

84
00:04:36,692 --> 00:04:38,567
Ha.

85
00:04:38,591 --> 00:04:42,363
Koʻp qulupnay bor edi.

86
00:04:42,386 --> 00:04:44,827
Juda chiroyli edi.

87
00:04:44,850 --> 00:04:47,916
Shirin narsalar yaxshi.

88
00:04:47,939 --> 00:04:51,013
Boshqa nima yedingiz?

89
00:04:51,037 --> 00:04:55,313
Limonli sharbat ichdim.

90
00:04:55,336 --> 00:04:58,336
Sharbat nordon emasmi?

91
00:04:58,359 --> 00:05:01,617
Juda nordon edi.

92
00:05:01,641 --> 00:05:05,774
Lekin ogʻzim tozalangan his qildi.

93
00:05:05,797 --> 00:05:10,564
Nordon narsalar sogʻliq uchun yaxshi.

94
00:05:10,587 --> 00:05:12,220
Ha.

95
00:05:12,243 --> 00:05:17,012
Soʻngra, oxirida koʻk choy ichdik.

96
00:05:17,035 --> 00:05:19,835
Koʻk choy qanday edi?

97
00:05:19,858 --> 00:05:23,825
Koʻk choy bir oz achchiqroq edi.

98
00:05:23,848 --> 00:05:26,981
Achchiq choy yoqtirmaysizmi?

99
00:05:27,004 --> 00:05:34,338
Yo'q, shirin pirogga keyin ichganim uchun juda mos keldi.

100
00:05:34,361 --> 00:05:35,894
Tushunarli.

101
00:05:35,917 --> 00:05:38,406
Kattalar uchun mazali.

102
00:05:38,429 --> 00:05:40,363
Ha.

103
00:05:40,386 --> 00:05:43,152
Juda mazali choy edi.

104
00:05:43,175 --> 00:05:46,942
U restoranga yana borishni xohlaysizmi?

105
00:05:46,965 --> 00:05:48,698
Ha.

106
00:05:48,721 --> 00:05:52,255
Keyingi hafta yana borishni rejalashtirganman.

107
00:05:52,278 --> 00:05:55,211
Keyin nima yeyishni rejalashtiryapsiz?

108
00:05:55,234 --> 00:06:00,410
Keyin baliq taomi va kari yeyishni xohlayman.

109
00:06:00,434 --> 00:06:03,601
Baliq taomlari ham mashhurmi?

110
00:06:03,624 --> 00:06:08,302
Doʻstlarim juda mazali ekanligini aytishdi.

111
00:06:08,325 --> 00:06:12,408
Men ham oʻsha restoranga borishni xohlayapman.

112
00:06:12,432 --> 00:06:15,065
Qaysi kun maqulroq?

113
00:06:15,088 --> 00:06:24,770
Eshitsangiz, iltimos, izoh qoldiring.

114
00:06:24,770 --> 00:06:27,770
Sahna 3: Sayohat xotiralari / Mening sayohatim xotiralari

115
00:06:27,770 --> 00:06:32,979
Oʻtgan hafta uzun dam olish kunlari boʻldi, shunday emasmi?

116
00:06:33,002 --> 00:06:36,242
Qayerga bordingizmi?

117
00:06:36,266 --> 00:06:37,999
Ha.

118
00:06:38,022 --> 00:06:43,959
Tokio, Kioto va Okinavaga bordim.

119
00:06:43,983 --> 00:06:46,160
Ajoyib!

120
00:06:46,184 --> 00:06:50,318
Koʻp joylarga borganingiz-ku!

121
00:06:50,342 --> 00:06:52,075
Ha.

122
00:06:52,098 --> 00:06:55,431
Juda band sayohat boʻldi.

123
00:06:55,454 --> 00:06:58,393
Tokio qanday edi?

124
00:06:58,417 --> 00:07:03,384
Tokio juda gavjum edi.

125
00:07:03,408 --> 00:07:06,408
Odamlar juda koʻp edi.

126
00:07:06,431 --> 00:07:09,997
Transport qulay edi-mi?

127
00:07:10,020 --> 00:07:11,954
Ha.

128
00:07:11,977 --> 00:07:17,350
Poyezdlar tez-tez kelardi, shuning uchun juda qulay edi.

129
00:07:17,374 --> 00:07:20,386
Kioto qanday edi?

130
00:07:20,409 --> 00:07:25,850
Kioto juda qadimiy va tinch shahar edi.

131
00:07:25,873 --> 00:07:28,886
Ibodatxonalar chiroyli edi-mi?

132
00:07:28,910 --> 00:07:30,583
Ha.

133
00:07:30,606 --> 00:07:34,006
Ibodatxonalar juda chiroyli edi.

134
00:07:34,029 --> 00:07:37,514
Yashillik ham koʻp edi.

135
00:07:37,537 --> 00:07:39,711
Juda yaxshi!

136
00:07:39,735 --> 00:07:42,701
Okinava qanday edi?

137
00:07:42,724 --> 00:07:47,058
Okinava juda issiq edi.

138
00:07:47,081 --> 00:07:50,314
Ob-havo yaxshi edi.

139
00:07:50,337 --> 00:07:53,153
Dengizni koʻrdingizmi?

140
00:07:53,176 --> 00:07:54,820
Ha.

141
00:07:54,844 --> 00:07:59,299
Dengiz juda keng va koʻk edi.

142
00:07:59,322 --> 00:08:02,803
Suzdingizmi?

143
00:08:02,826 --> 00:08:06,264
Yoʻq, suzmadim.

144
00:08:06,288 --> 00:08:10,488
Lekin yaqin atrofda sayr qildim.

145
00:08:10,511 --> 00:08:15,790
Uch joy ichida qaysi biri eng yoqdi?

146
00:08:15,813 --> 00:08:20,258
Menga Kioto eng yoqdi.

147
00:08:20,281 --> 00:08:23,695
Tinch joylarni yaxshi koʻraman.

148
00:08:23,719 --> 00:08:26,799
Okinava uzoqmi edi?

149
00:08:26,822 --> 00:08:33,311
Samolyotda ikki soat ketdi, shuning uchun biroz uzoq edi.

150
00:08:33,334 --> 00:08:35,167
Shunday ekan.

151
00:08:35,190 --> 00:08:38,793
Tabiat koʻp ekan, yaxshi!

152
00:08:38,817 --> 00:08:40,417
Ha.

153
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:43,507
Juda yaxshi tajriba boʻldi.

154
00:08:43,530 --> 00:08:48,263
Men keyingi oy sayohat qilishni rejalashtiryapman.

155
00:08:48,286 --> 00:08:50,953
Qayerga borishni oʻylaysiz?

156
00:08:50,976 --> 00:08:54,376
Kioto borishni oʻylayapman.

157
00:08:54,399 --> 00:08:57,932
Qadimiy binolarni koʻrishni xohlayman.

158
00:08:57,955 --> 00:09:01,388
Kioto yaxshi joy!

159
00:09:01,411 --> 00:09:04,478
Mazali shirinliklar ham koʻp.

160
00:09:04,501 --> 00:09:07,359
Nima yeyish kerak?

161
00:09:07,382 --> 00:09:11,263
Matcha muzqaymoq juda mazali!

162
00:09:11,287 --> 00:09:13,496
Albatta, tatib koʻring.

163
00:09:13,519 --> 00:09:15,519
Tushunarli.

164
00:09:15,542 --> 00:09:18,142
Albatta, yeyaman.

165
00:09:18,165 --> 00:09:21,165
Mehmonxona allaqachon tanlanganmi?

166
00:09:21,188 --> 00:09:24,722
Yoʻq, hali tanlanmagan.

167
00:09:24,745 --> 00:09:27,311
Qayer yaxshi boʻladi?

168
00:09:27,334 --> 00:09:31,701
Vokzal yaqinidagi mehmonxona qulay boʻladi.

169
00:09:31,724 --> 00:09:33,769
Koʻchib yurish oson.

170
00:09:33,793 --> 00:09:35,326
Shunday, rostdan.

171
00:09:35,349 --> 00:09:38,682
Internetda qidirib koʻrayapman.

172
00:09:38,705 --> 00:09:42,072
Yaxshi mehmonxona topilsa yaxshi boʻlardi.

173
00:09:42,095 --> 00:09:43,534
Ha.

174
00:09:43,557 --> 00:09:47,559
Tinch va toza mehmonxona yaxshi boʻladi.

175
00:09:47,583 --> 00:09:52,183
Kyoto kechalari ham juda chiroyli, zavqlaning.

176
00:09:52,206 --> 00:09:53,739
Rahmat.

177
00:09:53,762 --> 00:09:56,696
Koʻp suratga tushaman.

178
00:09:56,719 --> 00:10:00,519
Sovgʻalarni intiqlik bilan kutaman.

179
00:10:00,542 --> 00:10:01,989
Ha.

180
00:10:02,012 --> 00:10:04,945
Mazali shirinliklar olib kelaman.

181
00:10:04,968 --> 00:10:08,208
Ehtiyot boʻling, borib keling.

182
00:10:08,232 --> 00:10:11,232
4-Sahna: Maktab va oʻqituvchilar / Maktab hayoti va oʻqituvchilar

183
00:10:11,232 --> 00:10:15,598
Yangi maktabdagi hayotingiz qanday?

184
00:10:15,621 --> 00:10:18,788
Juda qiziqarli.

185
00:10:18,811 --> 00:10:22,744
Har kuni yangi odamlar bilan uchrashaman.

186
00:10:22,767 --> 00:10:24,837
Yaxshi ekan.

187
00:10:24,861 --> 00:10:28,904
Yapon tili oʻqituvchingiz qanday odam?

188
00:10:28,928 --> 00:10:33,661
Oʻqituvchi biroz qattiqqoʻl.

189
00:10:33,684 --> 00:10:39,298
Sinfxonaga kirganida doimo jiddiy yuz tutadi.

190
00:10:39,321 --> 00:10:42,255
Dars berishda mohirmi?

191
00:10:42,278 --> 00:10:43,811
Ha.

192
00:10:43,834 --> 00:10:49,801
Dars berish usuli juda yaxshi, shuning uchun yaxshi tushunaman.

193
00:10:49,824 --> 00:10:52,519
Bu xotirjamlik.

194
00:10:52,542 --> 00:10:56,075
Ishdagi ustozingiz qanday?

195
00:10:56,098 --> 00:11:00,465
Ustoz juda mehribon odam.

196
00:11:00,488 --> 00:11:02,821
Qiziqarli odammi?

197
00:11:02,844 --> 00:11:04,494
Ha.

198
00:11:04,518 --> 00:11:08,284
Har doim qiziqarli gaplar aytadi.

199
00:11:08,307 --> 00:11:10,774
Koʻp kulamiz.

200
00:11:10,797 --> 00:11:14,764
Muammoga duch kelganingizda yordam beradimi?

201
00:11:14,787 --> 00:11:16,353
Ha.

202
00:11:16,376 --> 00:11:22,027
Har doim mehribonlik bilan yordam beradi, shuning uchun xursandman.

203
00:11:22,051 --> 00:11:24,460
Yaxshi ustoz ekan.

204
00:11:24,484 --> 00:11:27,734
Sinfdoshlaringiz qanday?

205
00:11:27,758 --> 00:11:32,398
Doʻstlarim hammasi juda quvnoq.

206
00:11:32,421 --> 00:11:35,621
Va mehribon.

207
00:11:35,644 --> 00:11:38,244
Sinfda shovqin-suron bormi?

208
00:11:38,268 --> 00:11:39,956
Ha.

209
00:11:39,979 --> 00:11:44,379
Tanaffus vaqtida juda shovqin-suron boʻladi.

210
00:11:44,402 --> 00:11:47,202
Har kuni qiziqarli.

211
00:11:47,225 --> 00:11:51,924
Atrofingizda yaxshi odamlar koʻp ekan.

212
00:11:51,947 --> 00:11:56,125
Men juda omadliman deb oʻylayman.

213
00:11:56,149 --> 00:12:00,635
Doʻstlaringiz bilan birga qayerga bordingizmi?

214
00:12:00,659 --> 00:12:06,192
Oʻtgan shanba kuni hammamiz bogʻga bordik.

215
00:12:06,215 --> 00:12:09,215
Bogʻda nima qildingiz?

216
00:12:09,238 --> 00:12:13,815
Futbol oʻynadik, suratga tushdik.

217
00:12:13,838 --> 00:12:16,205
Qiziqarli koʻrinadi.

218
00:12:16,228 --> 00:12:19,286
Bento yedingizmi?

219
00:12:19,310 --> 00:12:20,843
Ha.

220
00:12:20,866 --> 00:12:26,345
Doʻstlarim mazali sendvich tayyorlab berishdi.

221
00:12:26,369 --> 00:12:29,446
Pazandachilikda mohir doʻstingiz ekan.

222
00:12:29,469 --> 00:12:31,280
Ha.

223
00:12:31,304 --> 00:12:34,183
Juda mazali edi.

224
00:12:34,207 --> 00:12:38,087
Men meva olib bordim.

225
00:12:38,110 --> 00:12:40,566
Qanday meva?

226
00:12:40,590 --> 00:12:44,072
Olma va banan olib ketdim.

227
00:12:44,096 --> 00:12:46,662
Hammamiz birga yedik.

228
00:12:46,685 --> 00:12:49,852
Ajoyib dam olish kunlari boʻldi, shunday emasmi?

229
00:12:49,875 --> 00:12:51,445
Ha.

230
00:12:51,468 --> 00:12:55,881
Navbatda ustozimizni ham birga chaqirmoqchimiz.

231
00:12:55,905 --> 00:12:59,471
Ustoz ham xursand boʻladi.

232
00:12:59,494 --> 00:13:02,028
Iltimos, unga murojaat qiling.

233
00:13:02,051 --> 00:13:06,386
Lekin ustozimiz band boʻlishi mumkin.

234
00:13:06,409 --> 00:13:09,576
Soʻramasangiz, bilib boʻlmaydi.

235
00:13:09,599 --> 00:13:11,599
Shunday, rostdan.

236
00:13:11,622 --> 00:13:15,189
Ertaga maktabda soʻrab koʻraman.

237
00:13:15,212 --> 00:13:18,145
Katta kursdoshlaringizni ham chaqirsangiz-chi?

238
00:13:18,168 --> 00:13:20,175
Yaxshi ekan!

239
00:13:20,198 --> 00:13:24,232
Katta kursdoshlarim sportni yaxshi koʻrishlarini aytishgan.

240
00:13:24,255 --> 00:13:29,502
Odamlar koʻp boʻlsa, yanada gavjum boʻladi, shunday emasmi?

241
00:13:29,526 --> 00:13:31,015
Ha.

242
00:13:31,039 --> 00:13:34,441
Katta tadbirga aylanib ketishi mumkin.

243
00:13:34,464 --> 00:13:37,343
Reja tuzish juda qiziqarli boʻladi.

244
00:13:37,367 --> 00:13:39,211
Ha.

245
00:13:39,235 --> 00:13:42,968
Bugun kechqurun jadvalni oʻylab koʻraman.

246
00:13:42,991 --> 00:13:45,569
Omadingizni bersin!

247
00:13:45,593 --> 00:13:47,793
Sizni qoʻllab-quvvatlayapman.

248
00:13:47,816 --> 00:13:49,583
Rahmat.

249
00:13:49,606 --> 00:13:52,178
Yaxshi reja tuzaman.

250
00:13:52,201 --> 00:13:55,201
5-Sahna: Anime tomosha qilishning zavqlari / Har xil anime turlaridan bahramand boʻlish

251
00:13:55,201 --> 00:14:00,451
Yaqinda qandaydir anime tomosha qilyapsizmi?

252
00:14:00,475 --> 00:14:01,490
Ha.

253
00:14:01,513 --> 00:14:05,247
Uchta anime koʻp tomosha qilaman.

254
00:14:05,270 --> 00:14:07,876
Koʻp koʻryapsiz-ku!

255
00:14:07,899 --> 00:14:10,232
Qanday animelar?

256
00:14:10,255 --> 00:14:16,622
Jangovar anime, sport anime va kundalik hayot haqidagi anime.

257
00:14:16,645 --> 00:14:19,811
Jangovar anime qanday?

258
00:14:19,834 --> 00:14:22,768
Juda zoʻr!

259
00:14:22,791 --> 00:14:25,724
Butun dunyoda mashhur.

260
00:14:25,747 --> 00:14:28,380
Gavjum animemi?

261
00:14:28,403 --> 00:14:29,970
Ha.

262
00:14:29,993 --> 00:14:34,873
Musiqasi baland va juda gavjum.

263
00:14:34,897 --> 00:14:37,763
Sport anime qanday?

264
00:14:37,786 --> 00:14:42,397
Sport anime juda qiziqarli va hissiyotli.

265
00:14:42,421 --> 00:14:44,388
Kuch-quvvat beradi.

266
00:14:44,411 --> 00:14:46,492
Qiziqarli emasmi?

267
00:14:46,516 --> 00:14:48,249
Ha.

268
00:14:48,272 --> 00:14:50,639
Juda qiziqarli!

269
00:14:50,662 --> 00:14:53,951
Har hafta tomosha qilishni intizorlik bilan kutaman.

270
00:14:53,974 --> 00:14:57,153
Kundalik hayot haqidagi anime qanday?

271
00:14:57,177 --> 00:15:01,777
Kundalik hayot haqidagi anime juda yoqimli.

272
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:04,167
Tinch hikoyami?

273
00:15:04,190 --> 00:15:05,756
Ha.

274
00:15:05,779 --> 00:15:09,752
Tinch va osoyishta hikoya.

275
00:15:09,775 --> 00:15:12,175
Yurak tinchlanadi.

276
00:15:12,198 --> 00:15:17,565
Uchta anime ichida qaysi biri eng yoqti?

277
00:15:17,588 --> 00:15:22,755
Menga sport anime eng yoqadi.

278
00:15:22,778 --> 00:15:24,778
Chunki juda taʼsirli boʻladi.

279
00:15:24,801 --> 00:15:27,567
Manga ham oʻqiysizmi?

280
00:15:27,590 --> 00:15:29,157
Ha.

281
00:15:29,180 --> 00:15:32,659
Jangovar anime mangasini oʻqiyapman.

282
00:15:32,683 --> 00:15:35,326
Manga ham qiziqarli emasmi?

283
00:15:35,349 --> 00:15:36,949
Ha.

284
00:15:36,972 --> 00:15:40,642
Mangadagi rasmlar juda chiroyli.

285
00:15:40,665 --> 00:15:43,603
Kitob doʻkonida sotib oldingizmi?

286
00:15:43,627 --> 00:15:47,714
Yoʻq, smartfon orqali oʻqiyapman.

287
00:15:47,738 --> 00:15:49,777
Juda qulay ekan.

288
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:54,734
Yaqinda chiqarilgan smartfonlarning ekranlari katta boʻladi-ku.

289
00:15:54,757 --> 00:15:56,123
Ha.

290
00:15:56,146 --> 00:15:59,213
Har qayerda oʻqish mumkin, shuning uchun.

291
00:15:59,236 --> 00:16:00,648
Yoqadi.

292
00:16:00,671 --> 00:16:04,005
Men anime koʻp koʻrmayman.

293
00:16:04,028 --> 00:16:07,228
Tavsiya qiladigan anime bormi?

294
00:16:07,251 --> 00:16:11,685
Unda, kundalik hayot haqidagi anime yaxshi boʻladi.

295
00:16:11,708 --> 00:16:14,341
Qisqa va tomosha qilish oson.

296
00:16:14,364 --> 00:16:16,731
Nomi nima?

297
00:16:16,754 --> 00:16:20,631
„Nonbir hayot“ degan anime.

298
00:16:20,654 --> 00:16:24,192
„Nonbir hayot“, shundaymi?

299
00:16:24,216 --> 00:16:26,467
Eslab qolaman.

300
00:16:26,490 --> 00:16:29,764
Bugun kechqurun vaqt bormi?

301
00:16:29,788 --> 00:16:31,193
Ha.

302
00:16:31,216 --> 00:16:33,425
Kechqurun boʻshman.

303
00:16:33,449 --> 00:16:36,307
Hech qanday rejam yoʻq.

304
00:16:36,331 --> 00:16:40,064
Unda, bir qismni koʻrib chiqing.

305
00:16:40,087 --> 00:16:42,946
Internetda tomosha qilish mumkin.

306
00:16:42,970 --> 00:16:44,837
Tushunarli.

307
00:16:44,859 --> 00:16:47,059
Koʻrib chiqaman.

308
00:16:47,082 --> 00:16:50,050
Fikringizni aytib bering, iltimos.

309
00:16:50,074 --> 00:16:51,316
Ha.

310
00:16:51,339 --> 00:16:54,339
Ertaga maktabda gaplashamiz.

311
00:16:54,362 --> 00:16:57,929
Yoqib yuborsangiz, yaxshi boʻlardi.

312
00:16:57,952 --> 00:17:00,354
Hayajonlanaman-ku!

313
00:17:00,378 --> 00:17:03,645
Yangi anime koʻrmagim uzoq vaqt boʻldi.

314
00:17:03,667 --> 00:17:06,201
Albatta yoqadi deb oʻylayman.

315
00:17:06,224 --> 00:17:07,424
Ha.

316
00:17:07,447 --> 00:17:10,918
Ertaga fikrlarimni aytaman.

317
00:17:10,942 --> 00:17:12,385
Ha.

318
00:17:12,408 --> 00:17:14,808
Ertaga koʻrishamiz!

319
00:17:14,831 --> 00:17:17,831
6-SAHNA: Xarid qilishning zavqi

320
00:17:17,831 --> 00:17:23,564
Kecha yangi ochilgan univermagga xarid qilishga bordim.

321
00:17:23,587 --> 00:17:25,681
Yaxshi ekan!

322
00:17:25,704 --> 00:17:28,471
Nima xarid qildingiz?

323
00:17:28,494 --> 00:17:33,661
Yangi krossovkalar va smartfon sotib oldim.

324
00:17:33,684 --> 00:17:36,622
Koʻp narsa xarid qildingiz-ku!

325
00:17:36,645 --> 00:17:40,516
Yangi krossovkalar qanday?

326
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:43,350
Juda yengil.

327
00:17:43,374 --> 00:17:48,040
Va piyoda yurishga qulay, shuning uchun yoqdi.

328
00:17:48,063 --> 00:17:51,230
Yaxshi boʻldi-ku.

329
00:17:51,253 --> 00:17:53,626
Arzon edi-mi?

330
00:17:53,649 --> 00:17:57,386
Ha, juda arzon edi.

331
00:17:57,409 --> 00:17:59,650
Besh ming yen boʻldi.

332
00:17:59,673 --> 00:18:03,073
Yaxshi xarid qildingiz-ku!

333
00:18:03,096 --> 00:18:06,696
Yangi smartfon qanday?

334
00:18:06,719 --> 00:18:11,553
Juda qulay, lekin qimmat edi.

335
00:18:11,576 --> 00:18:14,413
Ekrani katta-mi?

336
00:18:14,437 --> 00:18:21,105
Ha, ekrani katta boʻlgani uchun videolarni tomosha qilish juda qulay.

337
00:18:21,128 --> 00:18:23,222
Yaxshi ekan!

338
00:18:23,245 --> 00:18:26,850
Boshqa narsa koʻrdingizmi?

339
00:18:26,874 --> 00:18:30,731
Chiroyli soat bor edi.

340
00:18:30,755 --> 00:18:33,890
U soatni xarid qilmadingizmi?

341
00:18:33,913 --> 00:18:41,124
Ha, dizayni chiroyli edi, lekin biroz ogʻir boʻlgani uchun xarid qilmadim.

342
00:18:41,148 --> 00:18:42,926
Tushunarli.

343
00:18:42,949 --> 00:18:47,982
Har kuni ishlatiladigan narsalar yengilroq boʻlsa yaxshi boʻladi-ku.

344
00:18:48,005 --> 00:18:50,839
Ha, shunday.

345
00:18:50,862 --> 00:18:54,528
Keyin, qishki palto ham koʻrdim.

346
00:18:54,551 --> 00:18:57,797
Palto qanday edi?

347
00:18:57,821 --> 00:19:00,787
Juda issiqdek ko'rinardi.

348
00:19:00,810 --> 00:19:03,622
Sotib oldingizmi?

349
00:19:03,646 --> 00:19:09,450
Yo'q, rangi yoqmadi, shuning uchun sotib olmadim.

350
00:19:09,473 --> 00:19:13,728
Xarid qilish qiyin, lekin qiziqarli, shunday emasmi?

351
00:19:13,752 --> 00:19:21,441
Ha, snikers va smartfon orasida snikers eng yaxshi xarid bo'ldi.

352
00:19:21,464 --> 00:19:26,121
Keyinroq men ham shu univermagga borishni xohlayman.

353
00:19:26,145 --> 00:19:30,178
Unda, kelgusi hafta birga boramizmi?

354
00:19:30,201 --> 00:19:32,135
Yaxshi ekan!

355
00:19:32,158 --> 00:19:34,758
Birga boramiz.

356
00:19:34,781 --> 00:19:37,781
7-Sahna: Doʻstlar bilan kafe va restoranlarni kezish

357
00:19:37,781 --> 00:19:42,381
O'tgan hafta oxirida do'stlarim bilan chiqib ketdik.

358
00:19:42,404 --> 00:19:44,940
Qayerga bordingiz?

359
00:19:44,963 --> 00:19:50,580
Yangi kafe va vokzal yaqinidagi restoranga bordik.

360
00:19:50,604 --> 00:19:52,570
Yaxshi ekan!

361
00:19:52,593 --> 00:19:56,327
Yangi kafe qanday edi?

362
00:19:56,350 --> 00:19:59,350
Juda tinch joy edi.

363
00:19:59,373 --> 00:20:02,973
Kofe ham juda mazali edi.

364
00:20:02,996 --> 00:20:05,562
Doʻkon chiroyli edi-mi?

365
00:20:05,585 --> 00:20:10,152
Ha, juda chiroyli va zamonaviy edi.

366
00:20:10,175 --> 00:20:12,975
Odamlar koʻp edi-mi?

367
00:20:12,998 --> 00:20:17,815
Yo'q, uncha ko'p emas edi.

368
00:20:17,838 --> 00:20:20,838
Dam olish imkonini berdi.

369
00:20:20,861 --> 00:20:23,676
Bu yaxshi kafe ekan-ku!

370
00:20:23,700 --> 00:20:26,833
Restoran qanday edi?

371
00:20:26,856 --> 00:20:30,856
Restoran juda gavjum edi.

372
00:20:30,879 --> 00:20:33,547
Xizmat qanday edi?

373
00:20:33,571 --> 00:20:37,142
Xizmat juda yaxshi edi.

374
00:20:37,166 --> 00:20:40,699
Xodimlar hammasi mehribon edilar.

375
00:20:40,722 --> 00:20:43,455
Taomlar mazali edi-mi?

376
00:20:43,478 --> 00:20:47,212
Ha, juda mazali edi.

377
00:20:47,235 --> 00:20:51,468
Lekin, biroz qimmat edi.

378
00:20:51,491 --> 00:20:54,362
Bu maxsus kunlar uchun boriladigan restoran ekan.

379
00:20:54,385 --> 00:20:57,189
Ha, shunday.

380
00:20:57,213 --> 00:21:01,663
Keyinroq mashhur univermagga bordik.

381
00:21:01,686 --> 00:21:04,420
Univermag qanday edi?

382
00:21:04,443 --> 00:21:07,043
Juda keng edi.

383
00:21:07,066 --> 00:21:13,000
Va odamlar ko'p edi, shuning uchun biroz charchadim.

384
00:21:13,023 --> 00:21:17,877
Yakshanba kunlari univermagda odamlar ko'p bo'ladi-ku.

385
00:21:17,901 --> 00:21:23,235
Shuning uchun oxirida eski kitob do'koniga bordik.

386
00:21:23,258 --> 00:21:26,191
Kitob do'koni qanday edi?

387
00:21:26,214 --> 00:21:31,381
Biroz qorong'i edi, lekin qiziqarli kitoblar ko'p edi.

388
00:21:31,404 --> 00:21:36,337
To'rtta joy ichida qaysi biri eng ko'nglingizga yoqdimi?

389
00:21:36,360 --> 00:21:41,094
Menga yangi kafe eng yoqdi.

390
00:21:41,117 --> 00:21:43,208
Yana borishni xohlayman.

391
00:21:43,231 --> 00:21:47,442
Keyinroq shu do'kon nomini menga aytib qo'ying-ku.

392
00:21:47,466 --> 00:21:50,466
8-Sahna: Fasl voqealarini tajriba qilish

393
00:21:50,466 --> 00:21:55,099
Yaponiyada bir yil bo'ldi.

394
00:21:55,122 --> 00:21:59,090
Shundaymi? Tez o'tib ketdi-ku.

395
00:21:59,114 --> 00:22:00,847
Ha.

396
00:22:00,870 --> 00:22:06,471
Bir yil ichida turli fasl voqealarini boshdan kechirdim.

397
00:22:06,494 --> 00:22:10,571
Eng esda qolarli narsa nima edi?

398
00:22:10,594 --> 00:22:14,885
Yozgi festival va otashinlar shousi.

399
00:22:14,909 --> 00:22:17,676
Festival qanday edi?

400
00:22:17,699 --> 00:22:20,432
Juda gavjum edi.

401
00:22:20,455 --> 00:22:23,489
Odamlar juda koʻp edi.

402
00:22:23,511 --> 00:22:25,645
Qiziqarli boʻldimi?

403
00:22:25,668 --> 00:22:29,634
Ha, juda qiziqarli boʻldi.

404
00:22:29,657 --> 00:22:31,860
Yukata kiyib oldim.

405
00:22:31,884 --> 00:22:33,684
Yaxshi ekan!

406
00:22:33,707 --> 00:22:36,920
Bahorda gilos gullarini koʻrish qanday boʻldi?

407
00:22:36,944 --> 00:22:41,150
Bogʻdagi gilos gullari juda chiroyli edi.

408
00:22:41,173 --> 00:22:44,573
Doʻstlaringiz bilan bentō yedingizmi?

409
00:22:44,596 --> 00:22:50,363
Ha, hammamiz bilan yegan bentō juda mazali edi.

410
00:22:50,386 --> 00:22:52,919
Yaxshi boʻldi-ku.

411
00:22:52,942 --> 00:22:56,315
Kuzda qayerga bordingizmi?

412
00:22:56,338 --> 00:23:00,938
Ha, togʻga kuzgi ranglarni koʻrishga bordim.

413
00:23:00,961 --> 00:23:03,929
Kuzgi ranglar qanday edi?

414
00:23:03,953 --> 00:23:07,807
Togʻ qizil rangda juda chiroyli edi.

415
00:23:07,830 --> 00:23:11,363
Lekin, biroz sovuq edi.

416
00:23:11,386 --> 00:23:15,753
Kuzda togʻda ob-havo tez oʻzgaradi, shunday emasmi?

417
00:23:15,776 --> 00:23:20,943
Ha. Va qishda qor festivaliga bordim.

418
00:23:20,966 --> 00:23:23,574
Qor festivali qanday boʻldi?

419
00:23:23,597 --> 00:23:26,764
Juda sovuq edi.

420
00:23:26,787 --> 00:23:31,798
Lekin, oq qordan yasalgan haykallar juda goʻzal edi.

421
00:23:31,822 --> 00:23:36,662
Toʻrtta tadbirdan qaysi biri sizni eng koʻp hayratda qoldirdi?

422
00:23:36,685 --> 00:23:41,419
Menga yozgi festival eng yoqadi.

423
00:23:41,442 --> 00:23:45,114
Shov-shuvli muhitni juda yaxshi koʻraman.

424
00:23:45,137 --> 00:23:49,616
Yaponiyaning har bir fasli boshqacha va qiziqarli, shunday emasmi?

425
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:53,574
Ha, rostini aytsangiz, shunday.

426
00:23:53,598 --> 00:23:56,598
9-Sahna: Yarim kunlik ishning quvonchlari va qiyinchiliklari

427
00:23:56,598 --> 00:24:01,408
Yaqinda yangi yarim kunlik ish boshladim.

428
00:24:01,431 --> 00:24:03,564
Ajoyib!

429
00:24:03,587 --> 00:24:06,120
Qanday ish bu?

430
00:24:06,143 --> 00:24:12,549
Doʻkondagi yarim kunlik ish va yapon tili maktabidagi qabulxona ishidir.

431
00:24:12,573 --> 00:24:15,606
Ikki ishni birga qilayapsizmi?

432
00:24:15,629 --> 00:24:18,207
Qiyin boʻladi-ku.

433
00:24:18,231 --> 00:24:21,475
Ha, biroz bandman.

434
00:24:21,499 --> 00:24:24,432
Doʻkondagi ish qanday?

435
00:24:24,455 --> 00:24:29,389
Koʻp narsalarni yodlash kerak, qiyin.

436
00:24:29,412 --> 00:24:31,465
Qiziqarli emasmi?

437
00:24:31,488 --> 00:24:38,426
Ha, qiyin, lekin turli xil mahsulotlar borligi qiziqarli.

438
00:24:38,450 --> 00:24:41,650
Yapon tili maktabidagi qabulxonadagi ish qanday?

439
00:24:41,673 --> 00:24:46,966
Turli mamlakatlardan kelgan odamlar bilan gaplashish juda qiziqarli.

440
00:24:46,990 --> 00:24:49,867
Muhim ish ekan.

441
00:24:49,890 --> 00:24:56,738
Ha, koʻp muhim hujjatlar bor, shuning uchun jiddiy ishlayapman.

442
00:24:56,762 --> 00:25:01,095
Qaysi ish sizga mos keladi?

443
00:25:01,118 --> 00:25:05,403
Menga qabulxonadagi ishni koʻproq yoqtiraman.

444
00:25:05,426 --> 00:25:09,893
Odamlar bilan gaplashishni yaxshi koʻraman.

445
00:25:09,916 --> 00:25:13,723
Oldin restoranning oshxonasida ishlagansiz-ku.

446
00:25:13,747 --> 00:25:16,013
Ha, shunday.

447
00:25:16,036 --> 00:25:18,970
Oshxonadagi ish qanday edi?

448
00:25:18,993 --> 00:25:23,726
Xona juda issiq edi, qiyin boʻldi.

449
00:25:23,749 --> 00:25:25,839
Band boʻldingizmi?

450
00:25:25,863 --> 00:25:29,863
Ha, juda band edim.

451
00:25:29,886 --> 00:25:33,696
Lekin, oshpazlik mahoratim yaxshilandi.

452
00:25:33,719 --> 00:25:36,786
Bu yaxshi tajriba boʻldi-ku.

453
00:25:36,809 --> 00:25:44,296
Ha, hozirgi ish joylarimda hamma yaxshi va mehribon odamlar.

454
00:25:44,320 --> 00:25:46,732
Bu yaxshi yangilik ekan, xotirjam boʻling.

455
00:25:46,755 --> 00:25:50,724
Oʻzingizga yaxshi qaring va harakat qiling.

456
00:25:50,747 --> 00:25:52,514
Rahmat.

457
00:25:52,537 --> 00:25:54,704
Harakat qilaman.

458
00:25:54,727 --> 00:25:57,727
10-Sahna: Dam olish kunlarini qanday oʻtkazamiz / Dam olish kunlarini oʻtkazish

459
00:25:57,727 --> 00:26:03,360
Bu oy dam olish kunlarida turli xil ishlarni qildim.

460
00:26:03,383 --> 00:26:06,070
Qanday ishlar qildingiz?

461
00:26:06,094 --> 00:26:12,160
Birinchi dam olish kunida uyda kitob oʻqib, dam oldim.

462
00:26:12,183 --> 00:26:14,917
Kitob oʻqish qanday boʻldi?

463
00:26:14,940 --> 00:26:20,994
Uyda tinchlik boʻlgani uchun yaxshi oʻqidim.

464
00:26:21,017 --> 00:26:24,229
Kitob qiziqarli edi mi?

465
00:26:24,253 --> 00:26:28,858
Yoʻq, unchalik qiziqarli emas edi.

466
00:26:28,882 --> 00:26:31,524
Afsuski, bunday boʻlib qoldi.

467
00:26:31,547 --> 00:26:36,080
Keyingi dam olish kunida nima qildingiz?

468
00:26:36,103 --> 00:26:39,237
Doʻstlarim bilan tennis oʻynadim.

469
00:26:39,260 --> 00:26:41,543
Sport – bu yaxshi.

470
00:26:41,566 --> 00:26:43,771
Qanday boʻldi?

471
00:26:43,794 --> 00:26:47,054
Tana isib ketdi.

472
00:26:47,078 --> 00:26:52,444
Juda ham sergak boʻldim, lekin ertasi kuni charchadim.

473
00:26:52,467 --> 00:26:56,301
Siz odatda kamroq harakat qilasiz-ku.

474
00:26:56,323 --> 00:26:59,523
Ha, shunday.

475
00:26:59,546 --> 00:27:05,021
Keyingi dam olish kunida kinoteatrga kino koʻrishga bordim.

476
00:27:05,045 --> 00:27:07,688
Kino qanday boʻldi?

477
00:27:07,712 --> 00:27:11,998
Ovoz juda baland edi.

478
00:27:12,021 --> 00:27:15,675
Juda ham taʼsirli va hayratlanarli boʻldi.

479
00:27:15,698 --> 00:27:19,311
Kinoteatrda koʻrilgan kino alohida boʻladi-ku.

480
00:27:19,335 --> 00:27:22,968
Ha, juda yaxshi boʻldi.

481
00:27:22,991 --> 00:27:29,686
Va oxirgi dam olish kunida yaqin atrofdagi togʻga sayr qilishga bordim.

482
00:27:29,710 --> 00:27:32,489
Sayr qilish qanday boʻldi?

483
00:27:32,512 --> 00:27:35,314
Ob-havo yaxshi edi.

484
00:27:35,338 --> 00:27:39,139
Havo juda toza edi.

485
00:27:39,162 --> 00:27:40,829
Uzoqmi edi?

486
00:27:40,852 --> 00:27:45,260
Ha, biroz uzoq edi.

487
00:27:45,283 --> 00:27:49,856
Koʻp yurganim uchun oyoqlarim ogʻridi.

488
00:27:49,880 --> 00:27:54,647
Toʻrtta dam olish kunidan qaysi biri eng qiziqarli boʻldi?

489
00:27:54,670 --> 00:27:59,270
Menga sayr qilish eng qiziqarli boʻldi.

490
00:27:59,293 --> 00:28:02,893
Chunki tabiat juda koʻp edi.

491
00:28:02,916 --> 00:28:05,916
Ajoyib oy boʻldi-ku.

492
00:28:05,939 --> 00:28:10,272
Ha, juda ham mazmunli dam olish boʻldi.